{"text": "On a rainy afternoon, Lena and her grandad made a white paper boat. When the rain stopped, Lena put the boat into a little stream. The boat sailed very fast, and Lena ran next to it, laughing. Suddenly, the boat got stuck between two big stones. Grandad found a long stick and gently pushed the boat free. In the evening, the little boat floated on the pond with the ducklings.", "words": [[0.38, 0.53], [0.53, 0.64], [0.64, 1.11], [1.11, 2.12], [2.26, 2.68], [2.68, 2.79], [2.79, 2.93], [2.93, 3.83], [3.83, 4.05], [4.05, 4.17], [4.17, 4.56], [4.56, 4.97], [4.97, 5.53], [6.86, 6.97], [6.97, 7.09], [7.09, 7.55], [7.55, 8.33], [8.47, 8.81], [8.81, 9.0], [9.0, 9.13], [9.13, 9.5], [9.5, 9.77], [9.77, 9.83], [9.83, 10.16], [10.16, 10.91], [12.24, 12.33], [12.33, 12.71], [12.71, 13.15], [13.15, 13.51], [13.51, 14.31], [14.44, 14.56], [14.56, 14.91], [14.91, 15.21], [15.21, 15.51], [15.51, 15.67], [15.67, 15.94], [16.05, 16.81], [18.16, 18.83], [18.94, 19.06], [19.06, 19.36], [19.36, 19.62], [19.62, 20.06], [20.06, 20.51], [20.51, 20.8], [20.8, 21.1], [21.1, 21.88], [23.21, 23.82], [23.82, 24.16], [24.16, 24.27], [24.27, 24.73], [24.73, 25.53], [25.53, 25.69], [25.69, 26.14], [26.14, 26.48], [26.48, 26.58], [26.58, 26.91], [26.91, 27.46], [28.81, 28.9], [28.9, 29.05], [29.05, 29.81], [29.91, 30.03], [30.03, 30.35], [30.35, 30.74], [30.74, 31.17], [31.17, 31.27], [31.27, 31.4], [31.4, 32.12], [32.12, 32.31], [32.31, 32.45], [32.45, 33.37]], "scenes": [0.0, 6.48, 11.86, 17.76, 22.83, 28.41], "tag": "kokoro:bm_george"}